# Formatting for the C++ validation harness, enforced by .github/workflows/clang-format.yml.
# Applies only to this directory.
#
# The first four settings match upstream apache/arrow-adbc's .clang-format, so this harness
# stays diffable against the upstream adbc_validation_*.cc it extends. ReflowComments is off
# because reflowing breaks the hand-wrapped lists in our comments.
---
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 90
DerivePointerAlignment: false
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
ReflowComments: false
